avcodec/mediacodecdec: export packet properties and dynamic HDR metadata

MediaCodec returns neither the packets' properties nor the bitstream's
dynamic HDR metadata. Keep the properties of each input packet and parse
HEVC RPU NAL units and HDR10+ SEI, and AV1 ITU-T T.35 metadata OBUs, in
decode order. Apply them to the output frames matched by presentation
timestamp, as ff_decode_frame_props_from_pkt() does for native decoders,
with AV_FRAME_DATA_DOVI_METADATA, AV_FRAME_DATA_DOVI_RPU_BUFFER and
AV_FRAME_DATA_DYNAMIC_HDR_PLUS from the bitstream taking precedence the
same way.

Configure the codec with the stream's color range, standard and transfer,
which it reports back for a bitstream that leaves them out, such as VP9's
transfer characteristics.
